# Never commit a real key.
.env

# Generated demo artefacts. Reproducible in one command each — `make record` and
# `make capture` — so versioning ~12 MB of binaries would trade a permanent cost in every
# clone for something a contributor can regenerate in under a minute. The README hero is
# the one exception: a screenshot-first README (spec 00 A1) has to work on GitHub.
docs/demo.webm
docs/screenshots/
frontend/.video-tmp/

# Generated demo media. Regenerable with `make capture` / `make record`, and a
# multi-megabyte binary in git is weight every future clone pays for. The one
# exception is docs/screenshot-review.png — the README hero, which spec 00 A1
# requires and which is kept small deliberately.
docs/demo.webm
docs/screenshots/
frontend/.video-tmp/
